        ∑ p ∈ (Ms G).firstTops (X G) (R G).rep ((Ms G).nodeSize (S.withQ0 (q G)) hA SP (c G) h) σ₀,
          ‖∑ m ∈ ((Ms G).nodeComp (S.withQ0 (q G)) hA h p.2).filter
